{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"數碼通部分地區網絡服務不穩　現已陸續恢復正常\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SMAR-TONE-261126-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】數碼通部分地區網絡服務下午一度不穩，現已陸續恢復正常。</p><p>數碼通就事件致歉，指早前受影響的網絡服務已陸續恢復正常，如未能正常使用服務需重新啟動手機或開啟再關閉飛行模式，如果問題持續則要聯絡數碼通。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.716166+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:32.067890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:37:25.398797+00:00","content_hash":"645c3e169db63e6e777f9e3256860e522217a8e542cc1ad8624604eb4b62a5f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}